{"publicId":"79e66e83-9a78-4c56-8b8f-dafa0f063991","title":"Revolution Medicines新药RASONQUE首月销售额远超预期及股价上涨","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-12T14:53:58.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-12T14:53:58.000Z","digest":"Revolution Medicines 11月6日宣布，其针对胰腺癌的药物RASONQUE上市首周销售额达2.3亿美元，远超市场预期的8000万美元，成为近五年全球最畅销新药之一。销售超预期的主要驱动因素是医保覆盖范围扩大至23个州，使患者自付比例从65%降至35%。该药物通过抑制肿瘤微环境中的异常炎症反应发挥作用，已获得FDA突破性疗法认定，并因此启动加速审批通道。尽管尚未公布完整临床数据，但12月12日的市场分析显示，RASONQUE推动公司股价显著上涨，目前市值较上市前增长约20%。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-12T18:58:30.906Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"RASONQUE 开始强劲，Revolution Medicines 市值增长显著","latestReport":{"id":"ovxf32h3sa4b3y5vt35y7sacn"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":false,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fVwHtZeBSXCo","title":"RASONQUE Is Off To A Strong Start","firstReportAt":"2026-11-12T14:53:58.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"ovxf32h3sa4b3y5vt35y7sacn","title":"RASONQUE 开始强劲，Revolution Medicines 市值增长显著","summary":"Revolution Medicines 公司的药物 RASONQUE 自推出以来表现强劲，股价显著上涨。市场对其寄予厚望，但预期压力也很大。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T14:53:58.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"ovxf32h3sa4b3y5vt35y7sacn","title":"RASONQUE 开始强劲，Revolution Medicines 市值增长显著","summary":"Revolution Medicines 公司的药物 RASONQUE 自推出以来表现强劲，股价显著上涨。市场对其寄予厚望，但预期压力也很大。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T14:53:58.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-06T16:00:00.000Z","heat":5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","heat":4.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T18:00:00.000Z","heat":4.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T19:00:00.000Z","heat":4.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T20:00:00.000Z","heat":4.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T21:00:00.000Z","heat":4.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T22:00:00.000Z","heat":4.2,"participants"